WEBVTT

00:45.396 --> 00:46.623
SOCIAL

00:46.647 --> 00:47.666
SEX

00:47.690 --> 00:49.752
SECRET

00:51.109 --> 00:52.378
SEX LINE

00:52.402 --> 00:54.754
S LINE

00:54.778 --> 00:59.478
RED LINES THAT CONNECT SEXUAL PARTNERS

01:32.557 --> 01:34.715
Get up, Uncle.

01:35.830 --> 01:38.684
Come on.

01:39.729 --> 01:41.498
Get up.

01:41.522 --> 01:42.672
Leave me alone.

01:57.910 --> 01:58.845
Kang Seon-a.

01:58.869 --> 02:01.266
I never wanted much in life.

02:01.739 --> 02:06.486
All I wanted was to be free. That was it.

02:09.853 --> 02:11.820
But the things I wanted to be free from

02:12.550 --> 02:14.229
were thrown at me like chores.

02:32.452 --> 02:34.566
THE GLASSES

02:52.910 --> 02:54.540
When did they...

02:59.289 --> 03:00.536
That's unexpected.

03:03.626 --> 03:05.544
Hey. Come here.

03:05.919 --> 03:08.029
- Why?
- Just get over here.

03:10.590 --> 03:11.884
Lower your head a bit.

03:12.216 --> 03:13.367
Why?

03:18.929 --> 03:20.128
What's going on?

03:25.518 --> 03:27.771
When did you meet your wife again?

03:28.061 --> 03:29.260
In college.

03:30.188 --> 03:32.624
What about before?
Didn't you have any girlfriends?

03:32.648 --> 03:34.902
- Of course I did.
- How many?

03:35.233 --> 03:36.672
One.

03:41.530 --> 03:43.841
We are so different.

03:43.865 --> 03:45.112
That's not anything new.

03:46.200 --> 03:47.926
Why the new glasses?

03:48.702 --> 03:52.394
Are you trying to see the world
from a suspect's point of view?

03:52.830 --> 03:54.460
They don't suit you at all.

03:54.748 --> 03:55.947
Don't I know it.

04:02.629 --> 04:03.972
Can I help you?

04:07.550 --> 04:08.892
Bangju High School?

04:09.301 --> 04:10.451
Yes.

04:10.885 --> 04:12.132
Follow me.

04:18.641 --> 04:20.368
- Get over here.
- What the heck?

04:20.935 --> 04:23.620
What gives detectives
the right to do this?

04:23.979 --> 04:26.332
Get a warrant.

04:26.356 --> 04:28.226
Warrant, my ass.

04:28.482 --> 04:29.921
I'm not arresting you.

04:30.525 --> 04:32.545
I just want you to visit a friend.

04:32.569 --> 04:33.754
I need to check something.

04:33.778 --> 04:36.548
What friend?

04:36.572 --> 04:37.962
And check what?

04:38.698 --> 04:40.041
Come and see for yourself.

04:46.329 --> 04:47.672
Stand here for a minute.

05:04.301 --> 05:06.028
Damn it.

05:06.052 --> 05:07.683
Am I free to go now?

05:08.512 --> 05:09.662
Wait.

05:17.561 --> 05:20.373
Do you know if Seon-a had any boyfriends?

05:20.397 --> 05:21.547
Boyfriends?

05:22.898 --> 05:24.048
Kang Seon-a?

05:25.192 --> 05:26.419
I don't know about boyfriends,

05:26.443 --> 05:28.457
but I know she has someone she hates.

05:29.945 --> 05:31.432
Maybe it was you.

05:33.365 --> 05:35.235
Stop fooling around.

05:35.575 --> 05:38.692
You know what she always says.

05:39.202 --> 05:41.600
"I'm going to kill
that son of a bitch one day."

05:42.246 --> 05:45.795
I think she hates that person
even more than Kim Hye-yeong.

05:50.336 --> 05:52.302
Isn't it Hyeon-heup's birthday next week?

05:52.546 --> 05:53.696
What day is it?

05:54.339 --> 05:55.858
November 1st.

05:55.882 --> 05:57.176
Let's have a party!

05:57.550 --> 05:59.152
I don't want to.

05:59.176 --> 06:00.423
How come?

06:03.304 --> 06:06.613
I've never had one before.

06:07.057 --> 06:09.742
Sorry, but you don't have a choice.

06:23.403 --> 06:25.755
Want to meet up before the party,

06:25.779 --> 06:27.746
just the two of us?

06:32.660 --> 06:36.880
UNKNOWN NUMBER

06:40.249 --> 06:44.421
NOVEMBER 1ST.
YOU ARE INVITED TO A BIRTHDAY PARTY.

06:54.551 --> 06:58.340
NOVEMBER 1ST.
YOU ARE INVITED TO A BIRTHDAY PARTY.

06:59.013 --> 07:00.824
How's this color? I just bought it.

07:00.848 --> 07:02.283
- It looks awful.
- What?

07:02.307 --> 07:03.868
- Wipe it off.
- No way.

07:03.892 --> 07:05.714
- You should.
- Look, Ji-na's here.

07:10.272 --> 07:11.422
Hey.

07:11.773 --> 07:13.125
No practice today?

07:13.149 --> 07:14.731
What brought you to school?

07:15.776 --> 07:17.003
Nothing.

07:17.027 --> 07:20.527
Why are you so quiet today?

07:21.071 --> 07:22.221
Don't know.

07:22.990 --> 07:24.284
- What's with her?
- Weird.

07:33.623 --> 07:34.773
Ji-uk.

07:36.750 --> 07:39.895
I think there's a sexual assault case
against a minor.

07:39.919 --> 07:41.271
Su-min can handle that.

07:41.295 --> 07:43.741
I think it'd be good
if you gave her a hand.

07:44.131 --> 07:45.281
Who's the victim?

07:47.675 --> 07:49.161
A week ago...

07:50.927 --> 07:55.867
I went to this boy's house
and we drank together.

07:56.473 --> 08:00.885
We used to be K-pop idol trainees together
so we were close.

08:02.019 --> 08:04.033
We were drinking...

08:06.189 --> 08:10.361
and I blacked out for a while.

08:10.526 --> 08:12.012
When I woke up...

08:15.321 --> 08:17.287
I noticed my underwear

08:18.490 --> 08:20.600
was on back to front.

08:22.618 --> 08:24.536
What about the boy?

08:25.454 --> 08:28.714
He had sent me a text
that he was going out.

08:30.791 --> 08:36.162
Had you had sexual intercourse
before the incident?

08:38.922 --> 08:40.073
No.

08:40.632 --> 08:42.734
Why is she lying?

08:42.758 --> 08:44.486
What do you mean?

08:44.510 --> 08:45.445
Huh?

08:45.469 --> 08:46.619
Nothing.

08:47.971 --> 08:50.176
Let's go see the boy in question tomorrow.

08:52.933 --> 08:54.899
- Quick.
- We have to hurry.

09:01.064 --> 09:03.462
Kids these days...

09:03.899 --> 09:05.722
Even I wasn't like that in high school.

09:06.568 --> 09:08.534
What are you mumbling about?

09:09.362 --> 09:11.173
I said I'm fed up visiting schools.

09:11.197 --> 09:14.175
I graduated years ago.

09:14.199 --> 09:15.593
I know.

09:15.617 --> 09:18.350
There seem to be a lot of
school-related cases recently.

09:19.620 --> 09:20.771
Detective.

09:21.246 --> 09:22.541
Hello.

09:23.831 --> 09:25.989
- Hello.
- Hello.

09:28.209 --> 09:29.456
A virgin?

09:32.630 --> 09:34.164
No sex before marriage?

09:35.673 --> 09:37.592
Nice meeting you again.

09:39.551 --> 09:40.701
Except...

09:41.970 --> 09:43.936
You being here can't mean good news.

09:47.849 --> 09:49.768
How's Seon-a doing?

09:51.144 --> 09:53.301
She's still in the hospital.

09:56.314 --> 10:00.390
I wanted to visit her with the students.
Would that be okay?

10:02.027 --> 10:03.417
It's a little early for that.

10:04.696 --> 10:05.846
I see.

10:09.407 --> 10:12.908
You're wearing new glasses.

10:14.828 --> 10:16.267
They look good on you.

10:19.290 --> 10:20.920
Yeah, right.

10:22.667 --> 10:24.106
Your ears are red.

10:24.502 --> 10:27.092
Do you know Seo Han-yu in class 7, year 2?

10:27.421 --> 10:29.483
Han-yu? Yes.

10:37.721 --> 10:39.031
Seo Han-yu.

10:39.055 --> 10:41.213
How do you know Yoon Ji-na?

10:41.765 --> 10:42.916
She's just...

10:43.892 --> 10:45.618
a girl I know.

10:46.144 --> 10:48.158
We used to be trainees together.

10:48.395 --> 10:50.218
On the evening of September 20,

10:50.605 --> 10:53.195
did you drink together at your place?

10:54.150 --> 10:55.627
- Yes.
- Where were your parents?

10:55.651 --> 10:56.753
They're abroad.

10:56.777 --> 10:58.754
I came to Korea to become a singer

10:58.778 --> 11:00.113
and now I'm living by myself.

11:03.532 --> 11:06.361
Do you think it's okay
for you high school kids to drink?

11:07.201 --> 11:08.640
You seem pretty cocky.

11:16.375 --> 11:17.861
Sorry, Detective.

11:18.460 --> 11:21.673
I was stressed out from schoolwork.

11:27.216 --> 11:31.244
You're here as a suspect
in a sexual assault case.

11:32.387 --> 11:33.826
Are you aware of that?

11:37.141 --> 11:38.531
Is that what Ji-na said?

11:40.310 --> 11:41.700
I never slept with her.

11:42.270 --> 11:44.188
I don't want to.

11:45.230 --> 11:47.416
Kids these days are really something.

11:47.440 --> 11:49.262
With such innocent faces, too.

11:49.984 --> 11:51.917
We'll get something once we start digging.

12:08.956 --> 12:10.539
Are you done staring at me?

12:12.334 --> 12:14.020
I was going to tell you first.

12:14.044 --> 12:15.386
Give them here.

12:16.504 --> 12:20.484
They're evidence from a case.
I can't just give them to you.

12:20.924 --> 12:23.485
And it's okay for you
to wear the evidence?

12:23.509 --> 12:26.321
I need to test them out.

12:26.345 --> 12:28.982
Isn't that for the KCSI to do?

12:30.389 --> 12:33.075
Yes. You're correct.

12:34.059 --> 12:36.121
As soon as I put these glasses on,

12:38.104 --> 12:41.940
I realized you were telling the truth
and got goosebumps all over.

12:42.232 --> 12:43.584
It's a relief, isn't it?

12:43.608 --> 12:46.711
I trust you, and you trust me.

12:46.735 --> 12:48.212
I don't trust you.

12:48.236 --> 12:49.547
Get rid of the glasses now.

12:49.571 --> 12:51.249
Calm down.

12:53.449 --> 12:56.661
Detective, haven't you learned anything
from Seon-a's case?

12:57.285 --> 12:58.915
And remember my neighbor?

13:00.662 --> 13:03.827
You said you found the glasses
at a crime scene.

13:04.332 --> 13:05.627
Don't you get it?

13:06.125 --> 13:08.728
Every case is related to them.

13:08.752 --> 13:09.979
Wearing them is dangerous.

13:10.003 --> 13:12.448
You're pretty convincing.

13:13.714 --> 13:15.900
All the more reason
for me to try these on.

13:15.924 --> 13:18.735
- And how could they be dangerous...
- I'm not saying the glasses are.

13:18.759 --> 13:21.112
You don't know
how they're going to change you.

13:21.136 --> 13:22.767
What's going on here?

13:24.264 --> 13:25.606
Is something wrong?

13:32.603 --> 13:35.193
Nothing's wrong.
She lives in my neighborhood.

13:43.111 --> 13:46.708
Hyeon-heup's a special kid.

13:48.532 --> 13:51.985
Would you like to have dinner
with me sometime?

13:52.785 --> 13:53.935
Sorry?

13:55.370 --> 13:57.145
I'll call you.

14:28.729 --> 14:31.271
Hello. You're here nice and early.

14:31.440 --> 14:32.830
Please, take a seat.

14:34.650 --> 14:35.993
Yoon Ji-na.

14:36.527 --> 14:39.356
I discovered her myself.

14:39.571 --> 14:42.466
But she didn't try very hard.

14:42.490 --> 14:45.510
So I told her to quit
if she didn't have her heart in it.

14:45.534 --> 14:50.569
I'm not the type to force people
into doing something they don't want to.

14:52.205 --> 14:55.370
What was Ji-na like?

14:56.959 --> 15:01.275
I'm embarrassed to say this,

15:02.088 --> 15:05.650
but she wasn't that talented.

15:05.674 --> 15:09.462
She should have tried harder
to make up for that.

15:09.593 --> 15:11.279
But she didn't push herself.

15:11.303 --> 15:14.031
On top of that, she liked
hanging out with her friends too much.

15:14.055 --> 15:16.658
She'd always talk the other trainees
into drinking with her

15:16.682 --> 15:18.696
or meet boys.

15:19.851 --> 15:22.249
It's no surprise she didn't make it.

15:22.437 --> 15:26.513
We shouldn't rule out the possibility
that it's a false accusation.

15:28.233 --> 15:29.815
Don't make any assumptions yet.

15:31.527 --> 15:33.972
My head hurts.
I hate these kinds of cases.

15:34.654 --> 15:35.997
What do you mean?

15:36.405 --> 15:37.748
The "he said, she said" type.

15:39.032 --> 15:41.385
Plus, they're both minors,

15:41.409 --> 15:44.722
and the case is sensitive in nature,
so we can't really interrogate them.

15:46.205 --> 15:48.746
We need something like

15:49.249 --> 15:50.639
a foolproof lie detector.

15:59.256 --> 16:01.222
Strange.

16:02.050 --> 16:03.920
- What is?
- It doesn't make sense.

16:05.302 --> 16:06.549
What are you talking about?

16:07.679 --> 16:08.830
It's nothing.

16:11.015 --> 16:14.228
By the way,

16:14.601 --> 16:16.579
do you have a crush on
Seon-a's homeroom teacher?

16:16.603 --> 16:17.753
What?

16:19.688 --> 16:22.134
Where the heck is this coming from?

16:24.025 --> 16:25.464
Never mind if not.

16:33.991 --> 16:35.286
She was annoying.

16:37.076 --> 16:39.282
Always calling me up, wanting to see me.

16:40.246 --> 16:41.828
I'm going to be a senior soon

16:43.373 --> 16:44.859
and not even a trainee anymore.

16:46.459 --> 16:48.473
Can I see your text messages?

16:48.835 --> 16:49.986
Go ahead.

16:56.133 --> 16:58.068
JI-NA: I'M EXHAUSTED. CAN I COME OVER?

16:58.092 --> 17:00.404
RIGHT NOW?
JI-NA: YES. ARE YOU BUSY?

17:00.428 --> 17:02.780
JUST A LITTLE...?

17:02.804 --> 17:05.032
JI-NA: I WON'T STAY LONG.
I'M SO DEPRESSED.

17:05.056 --> 17:07.367
ARE YOU COMING RIGHT NOW? FOR A DRINK?
JI-NA: YES!

17:07.391 --> 17:09.070
You deleted your texts,

17:09.601 --> 17:11.037
washed the clothes

17:11.061 --> 17:14.130
and the bloodstained underwear
you were wearing that day,

17:14.563 --> 17:18.064
and filed charges
only after a whole week passed.

17:18.858 --> 17:20.008
Did it cross your mind

17:21.152 --> 17:24.077
that these circumstances
wouldn't play out in your favor?

17:26.239 --> 17:27.507
I already told you.

17:27.531 --> 17:29.926
I didn't want to believe
what happened was true.

17:29.950 --> 17:32.252
You might be charged
with false accusation.

17:33.369 --> 17:34.568
Detective.

17:35.746 --> 17:38.097
It was me who washed Ji-na's clothes.

17:39.750 --> 17:41.909
It's not Ji-na's fault.

17:51.347 --> 17:54.849
DONG-SIK: NOTHING MUCH TO GO ON HERE.
I'M SENDING HAN-YU HOME NOW.

17:56.561 --> 17:57.712
Please excuse me.

18:49.579 --> 18:50.778
Yoon Ji-na.

18:51.539 --> 18:53.170
I'm asking you for the last time.

18:55.085 --> 18:56.812
Were you coerced into...

18:58.130 --> 18:59.281
I mean...

19:02.426 --> 19:06.168
Did anything actually happen
between you and Seo Han-yu?

19:14.690 --> 19:17.036
Don't transfer this case
to the Prosecutors' Office.

19:17.318 --> 19:18.469
What?

19:24.743 --> 19:26.662
"Hey, Sunglasses."

19:35.713 --> 19:37.057
Not calling me that today?

19:38.800 --> 19:41.678
When did I ever?

20:17.844 --> 20:19.139
This is for you.

20:22.516 --> 20:24.195
It's not exactly a gift, but still.

20:26.270 --> 20:27.709
I read your case file.

20:28.439 --> 20:30.934
What happened to your parents
is not your fault.

20:32.026 --> 20:33.945
In case that's what you were thinking.

20:34.988 --> 20:36.715
So that's what she looked like.

20:38.283 --> 20:40.682
She looks different from what I remember.

20:44.624 --> 20:46.926
Do you want to find her?

20:49.629 --> 20:50.925
Seon-a said

20:53.676 --> 20:56.602
if she were alive,
she'd have come to see me.

21:04.229 --> 21:05.956
Like you said, these glasses

21:07.024 --> 21:08.319
may be dangerous,

21:09.026 --> 21:11.377
but I'm positive
they can help someone out.

21:11.821 --> 21:15.083
Just like you saved
that woman in apartment 204.

21:19.329 --> 21:22.112
Who is it that you're saving now?

21:25.628 --> 21:28.314
Do you know Yoon Ji-na?
She's in your class.

21:29.925 --> 21:31.076
Yes.

21:32.052 --> 21:34.115
She reported someone for sexual assault.

21:34.930 --> 21:36.513
The case has been dismissed.

21:37.391 --> 21:38.590
I used these.

21:40.603 --> 21:43.385
There was no S line between the two.

21:43.565 --> 21:45.915
Yoon Ji-na said she had
no sexual experience,

21:46.193 --> 21:48.207
but she had four S lines.

21:49.238 --> 21:50.966
I knew you wouldn't make it
as a K-pop idol.

21:50.990 --> 21:52.759
- Serves you right.
- Serves you right.

21:52.783 --> 21:54.127
Yoon Ji-na

21:55.995 --> 21:57.578
could be telling the truth.

21:59.875 --> 22:03.616
Just a week ago,
she didn't have any S lines.

22:07.592 --> 22:08.485
Hello?

22:08.509 --> 22:10.404
Have you transferred the Yoon Ji-na case?

22:10.428 --> 22:11.572
No, I'm working on it.

22:11.596 --> 22:13.616
- Wait till I get there.
- Why?

22:13.640 --> 22:15.271
We're going back to square one.

22:33.204 --> 22:36.466
This doesn't feel quite right.

22:41.797 --> 22:42.996
Seo Han-yu.

22:43.674 --> 22:45.736
It's the police. Are you home?

22:52.600 --> 22:53.800
Seo Han-yu.

23:04.947 --> 23:07.202
- You...
- Hello, Detective.

23:10.412 --> 23:12.762
Can we come in?

23:14.834 --> 23:16.704
Sure, go ahead.

23:38.902 --> 23:41.253
You keep a tidy home.

23:42.823 --> 23:43.800
Yes.

23:43.824 --> 23:47.278
I'm a bit of a clean freak.

23:52.167 --> 23:53.366
Did you drink

23:54.044 --> 23:55.339
over here that night?

23:57.089 --> 23:59.823
We started there, but she blacked out,

24:00.968 --> 24:02.264
so I put her on the bed.

24:07.142 --> 24:08.292
Okay.

24:08.894 --> 24:10.861
Are the bottles you drank from still here?

24:11.730 --> 24:14.705
No. I don't keep things like that.

24:23.619 --> 24:24.769
Detectives.

24:26.998 --> 24:29.492
I have an early morning tomorrow.

24:31.669 --> 24:32.917
Can I get some sleep?

24:36.884 --> 24:39.810
CLOSED

24:52.651 --> 24:55.002
MISEONG MOTEL

25:19.306 --> 25:20.951
I went back to the scene just in case

25:20.975 --> 25:23.421
and found the glasses in the bathtub.

25:25.480 --> 25:27.686
What if someone intended

25:29.067 --> 25:31.657
for you to take the glasses?

25:32.529 --> 25:33.882
Impossible.

25:33.906 --> 25:35.655
How could they have known I'd be back?

25:37.368 --> 25:39.718
You can't expect things to make sense.

25:41.289 --> 25:43.208
Like the fact that I see S lines

25:44.292 --> 25:45.492
or those glasses.

25:47.004 --> 25:50.170
I know someone put the glasses
at the crime scene on purpose.

25:53.469 --> 25:55.868
Who could it be?

26:41.231 --> 26:43.486
- How did you...
- I just...

26:44.026 --> 26:45.629
I saw you while I was passing by.

26:45.653 --> 26:49.394
I wondered what was up and followed you,

26:49.907 --> 26:51.730
but you disappeared around here.

26:52.494 --> 26:53.837
You weren't taking my calls.

27:00.085 --> 27:03.731
What brought you back here?

27:04.298 --> 27:08.184
I left something during my shift.

27:08.887 --> 27:12.485
Aren't you scared? It's creepy here.

27:20.191 --> 27:21.343
Remember?

27:22.193 --> 27:25.048
I told you I could see weird things.

27:25.072 --> 27:26.223
Yes.

27:28.617 --> 27:29.767
There's something

27:30.494 --> 27:31.934
above your head...

27:34.165 --> 27:35.316
Stop.

28:03.281 --> 28:04.431
If I were to get

28:05.242 --> 28:07.208
an S line,

28:12.166 --> 28:14.085
I think it'd be okay if I saw things...

28:14.877 --> 28:16.027
What?

28:16.337 --> 28:19.743
...as long as I'm with you.

28:36.276 --> 28:38.915
Starting the day with grueling work.
What a morning.

28:48.248 --> 28:49.495
This looks okay.

29:10.940 --> 29:12.090
Found it.

29:16.822 --> 29:19.316
Okay. Thank you.

29:21.869 --> 29:24.028
How long is the forensics going to take?

29:25.081 --> 29:26.376
A day at the shortest.

29:28.209 --> 29:31.999
How did you get the idea
of looking for the bedsheets?

29:33.549 --> 29:34.748
The sheets...

29:39.430 --> 29:41.733
The color bothered me.

29:43.101 --> 29:44.972
It didn't match the interior.

29:47.439 --> 29:51.295
He threw away perfectly good sheets

29:51.319 --> 29:53.861
not in the trash,
but a clothing donation bin.

29:55.740 --> 29:57.179
He's got something to hide.

30:01.163 --> 30:02.314
Except...

30:16.430 --> 30:18.589
There's something I can't figure out.

30:19.684 --> 30:23.425
Humans acquire deviation
from interacting with others.

30:25.732 --> 30:26.931
Seo Han-yu.

30:27.609 --> 30:28.759
Get over here.

30:29.737 --> 30:31.224
Make it quick!

31:07.404 --> 31:10.138
Don't I get to eat? I'm starving.

31:19.083 --> 31:20.858
I'm going to ask you again.

31:21.586 --> 31:23.505
Why did you throw out the sheets?

31:24.965 --> 31:26.740
I'm a clean freak.

31:28.344 --> 31:30.119
I can't sleep on used sheets.

31:30.471 --> 31:32.220
I've already told you like five times.

31:33.183 --> 31:35.101
How did Ji-na's blood get on the sheets?

31:35.435 --> 31:36.537
I have no idea.

31:36.561 --> 31:38.480
Maybe she had a nosebleed.

31:39.440 --> 31:40.687
Or got her period.

31:49.951 --> 31:51.246
Han-yu.

31:53.205 --> 31:54.500
You see...

31:56.000 --> 31:57.966
I know you didn't do anything.

31:58.336 --> 32:00.830
I totally believe you. Want to know why?

32:01.714 --> 32:05.744
Good-looking guys like us
can't keep girls away.

32:07.888 --> 32:09.683
Yoon Ji-na came on to you first, right?

32:10.766 --> 32:12.445
Though you weren't that interested.

32:18.775 --> 32:20.502
I told you the truth before.

32:22.154 --> 32:23.641
She's not my type.

32:24.448 --> 32:26.559
There are people who say she's hot,

32:27.410 --> 32:28.560
but not me.

32:28.953 --> 32:31.544
She insisted on coming, so I let her.

32:31.957 --> 32:33.434
I had some whisky left,

32:33.458 --> 32:35.521
so I gave her that
and she drank all of it.

32:36.962 --> 32:38.497
You have whisky at home?

32:39.340 --> 32:40.683
What brand?

32:43.052 --> 32:44.587
I'm a whisky drinker myself.

32:46.973 --> 32:48.221
Glenfiddich.

32:48.934 --> 32:50.084
And then what?

32:50.477 --> 32:52.108
She downed the bottle,

32:52.813 --> 32:55.308
got herself drunk,
and said she didn't want to go home.

32:56.567 --> 32:58.007
She even wanted another drink.

32:58.903 --> 33:01.062
So I got her a beer
from a convenience store.

33:01.615 --> 33:02.958
She passed out after that.

33:03.617 --> 33:04.998
Mixing drinks is a bad choice.

33:05.494 --> 33:07.365
How were you able to buy the beer?

33:07.705 --> 33:09.672
The convenience store never checks IDs.

33:11.376 --> 33:12.815
Go see for yourself.

33:20.010 --> 33:21.353
Glenfiddich, my ass.

33:26.476 --> 33:27.626
Ji-uk.

33:27.894 --> 33:31.492
The only usable surveillance camera
footage is from the parking lot.

33:32.316 --> 33:35.536
With the number of residents
in the building, there's a lot of traffic.

33:35.611 --> 33:38.873
The time Ji-na entered the building,

33:39.032 --> 33:40.885
the time Han-yu went out and came back,

33:40.909 --> 33:43.547
and the time he left
in the morning all checks out.

33:45.372 --> 33:47.934
How long was he gone to get the beer?

33:47.958 --> 33:49.925
Five, ten minutes?

33:51.504 --> 33:55.198
If somebody intruded
during that time slot,

33:55.550 --> 33:59.052
the S line can be explained.

34:02.057 --> 34:05.271
That would mean she had passed out
before drinking the beer.

34:06.854 --> 34:08.102
What line?

34:09.858 --> 34:11.057
It's nothing.

34:14.112 --> 34:15.743
Hey, stop it right there.

34:17.908 --> 34:19.395
When did these punks get in?

34:19.869 --> 34:22.124
About an hour ago.

34:22.705 --> 34:23.953
There.

34:26.334 --> 34:28.396
Weren't there cameras
at the back of the building?

34:28.420 --> 34:29.763
No.

34:30.464 --> 34:31.759
Rewind.

34:40.726 --> 34:45.187
One, two, three...

34:46.315 --> 34:49.145
One, two, three, four, five...

34:56.201 --> 34:58.456
From six to seven lines.

34:59.330 --> 35:01.009
Four to five lines.

35:01.749 --> 35:05.587
One, two, three...

35:09.675 --> 35:12.121
Fucking punks.

35:27.570 --> 35:29.009
So that's Ji-na?

35:31.157 --> 35:32.884
Bring them with you.

35:33.159 --> 35:34.387
Do you have cigarettes?

35:34.411 --> 35:36.389
- No.
- Not again.

35:36.413 --> 35:37.660
You can't be serious.

35:45.173 --> 35:47.523
DETECTIVE HAN

35:54.975 --> 35:57.230
SUNGLASSES

36:01.065 --> 36:03.544
Fuck. I don't have the time for this.

36:03.568 --> 36:05.199
I want a lawyer.

36:05.570 --> 36:07.441
- What are you typing?
- Hey.

36:25.635 --> 36:28.081
Please, can't you just let me go home?

36:43.613 --> 36:45.772
I didn't do anything.

36:45.991 --> 36:48.053
Let me go. Please.

36:48.702 --> 36:51.149
My mom's going to kill me.

36:51.455 --> 36:52.654
Please.

36:54.750 --> 36:57.101
Okay, I'll drive you home. Come on.

37:12.145 --> 37:13.680
Detective.

37:14.439 --> 37:16.334
I live in the opposite direction.

37:16.358 --> 37:17.509
Yes, I know.

37:19.570 --> 37:20.913
Where are we going?

37:23.991 --> 37:25.386
What do you think of this car?

37:25.410 --> 37:26.849
Pretty smooth, isn't it?

37:28.288 --> 37:30.111
Can you just tell me where we're going?

37:32.668 --> 37:35.882
God, this red light is crazy long.

37:39.884 --> 37:41.467
Why are we here?

37:43.388 --> 37:44.635
Is this place familiar?

37:51.898 --> 37:53.673
Detective Oh, come with me.

38:13.964 --> 38:15.114
Okay.

38:15.883 --> 38:18.665
What should we have for dinner?
Maybe get some soju?

38:19.136 --> 38:20.286
Ji-uk.

38:20.596 --> 38:22.515
We don't have much time.

38:22.766 --> 38:24.492
We have to let Seo Han-yu go soon.

38:26.186 --> 38:28.625
Also, we don't have cause
to keep that kid in custody.

38:29.481 --> 38:31.064
Good. Keep talking.

38:33.986 --> 38:36.049
But try to keep a frown on.

38:36.614 --> 38:37.766
What for?

38:39.201 --> 38:40.400
Isn't it obvious?

38:41.328 --> 38:42.514
He's ready to piss himself.

38:42.538 --> 38:47.814
All we need to do is wait
with a dead serious face.

38:49.462 --> 38:50.805
I say

38:51.548 --> 38:52.987
he'll break in ten minutes.

39:02.310 --> 39:03.871
Hey, Beom-ju. Get out of the car.

39:03.895 --> 39:06.389
- What? I don't...
- Just get out for a minute.

39:07.190 --> 39:08.584
Where are you taking me?

39:08.608 --> 39:11.391
It's not far. It won't take long.

39:11.779 --> 39:12.978
Where are we going?

39:13.697 --> 39:16.051
Can't you please just take me home?

39:16.075 --> 39:18.179
We'll have a look around the crime scene,

39:18.203 --> 39:19.555
and we'll go back...

39:19.579 --> 39:20.922
Damn it.

39:23.959 --> 39:25.974
Now that's a confession.

39:33.094 --> 39:35.061
Fucking prick.

39:37.683 --> 39:39.458
He's a super fast runner, isn't he?

39:40.561 --> 39:41.712
Yes.

39:43.314 --> 39:45.137
- Detective.
- Yes?

39:45.483 --> 39:47.306
I really want to go home.

39:48.236 --> 39:51.930
I'll take you.
But we're going back to the station first.

39:52.741 --> 39:54.756
Why? What about the other guys?

39:55.035 --> 39:56.475
I sent them home.

39:58.414 --> 39:59.564
How come?

40:01.167 --> 40:02.750
I didn't have much on them.

40:03.211 --> 40:06.041
What about me? Why can't I go home?

40:07.466 --> 40:08.616
You...

40:10.136 --> 40:12.006
I think I've got enough on you.

40:12.680 --> 40:15.318
No way.

40:16.059 --> 40:18.122
You can't do this!

40:21.190 --> 40:23.540
You can't do this!

40:24.402 --> 40:25.985
Damn it!

40:26.362 --> 40:28.041
Calm down. You're going to get hurt.

40:39.961 --> 40:41.304
Jerks.

40:44.966 --> 40:46.213
Detective.

40:46.718 --> 40:50.076
I won't get detained
if I'm absolutely honest, will I?

40:54.018 --> 40:55.168
Well,

40:56.312 --> 40:58.183
that depends on what you say.

41:00.484 --> 41:02.019
I did do it,

41:03.237 --> 41:04.580
but it wasn't just me.

41:05.614 --> 41:07.485
It's not my fucking fault.

41:09.452 --> 41:11.994
That scumbag Han-yu planned everything.

41:12.288 --> 41:14.927
I was always on
about how hot Yoon Ji-na was,

41:15.208 --> 41:16.936
and one day the guys called me up.

41:16.960 --> 41:19.407
They asked how much I'd pay
to do it with Yoon Ji-na.

41:19.630 --> 41:22.508
I only went there
because I wanted to drink with her.

41:23.301 --> 41:25.279
She was out cold
because Han-yu had drugged her.

41:25.303 --> 41:28.658
Detective, it was Han-yu.
He told us what to do.

41:28.682 --> 41:29.881
It wasn't...

41:30.684 --> 41:33.288
It wasn't just me. We were all in on it.

41:33.312 --> 41:36.041
Can you let me off just this once?

41:36.065 --> 41:38.559
That asshole Han-yu
planned the whole thing.

41:38.735 --> 41:42.237
I only did it because my friends said to!

41:44.324 --> 41:48.114
Han-yu was sitting there
watching us the whole time, the pervert.

41:58.632 --> 41:59.783
This is yours, isn't it?

42:03.804 --> 42:05.699
- What is it?
- I found it in your room.

42:05.723 --> 42:07.840
As if.
It was in the fire extinguisher cabinet.

42:13.816 --> 42:15.734
Did you use this to drug Ji-na?

42:18.237 --> 42:21.163
Do you have proof I did?

42:22.409 --> 42:24.135
I just had this for a laugh.

42:25.996 --> 42:28.183
Let's see if the judge
thinks it's funny, shall we?

42:28.207 --> 42:29.810
The other kids came clean.

42:29.834 --> 42:31.560
You have four witnesses against you.

42:38.051 --> 42:40.258
I'm not the rapist.

42:41.513 --> 42:44.248
Those scumbags are.

42:49.147 --> 42:50.297
Sure, you're right.

42:50.648 --> 42:52.231
But you're the ringleader.

42:53.026 --> 42:54.657
You creep.

42:58.949 --> 43:00.197
Detective.

43:02.120 --> 43:03.415
Will they be punished?

43:05.582 --> 43:07.645
I did everything I could.

43:08.335 --> 43:10.254
The court will do the rest.

43:12.047 --> 43:15.933
Putting these glasses on the judge
would definitely do the trick.

43:18.179 --> 43:19.618
Wearing the glasses

43:23.018 --> 43:25.177
doesn't let you see the truth.

43:30.735 --> 43:31.886
I suppose.

43:41.622 --> 43:44.548
If I get tons of S lines like you,

43:45.919 --> 43:47.550
I might become more indifferent.

43:48.588 --> 43:50.075
Is this an insult?

43:54.386 --> 43:59.423
NURSING HOME

44:03.563 --> 44:05.386
You can walk home from here, can't you?

44:05.649 --> 44:07.616
Something urgent came up.

44:09.236 --> 44:10.388
Sure.

44:29.467 --> 44:33.305
YOO JUN-SEON

44:33.388 --> 44:35.211
When did he go missing?

44:35.891 --> 44:38.453
This isn't the first time.
Are you sure he isn't here?

44:38.477 --> 44:40.164
I... I think...

44:40.188 --> 44:43.250
I found him on the roof the last time.

44:43.274 --> 44:46.153
I think you need to come and see this.

44:49.365 --> 44:52.003
We haven't seen her before,

44:52.159 --> 44:54.750
and we don't know how she got in.

45:20.858 --> 45:22.153
Seon-a's homeroom teacher?

45:27.949 --> 45:31.067
UNKNOWN NUMBER

45:37.210 --> 45:38.229
Dong-sik.

45:38.253 --> 45:40.411
Run a background check on Lee Gyu-jin.

47:34.090 --> 47:35.242
Father...

47:46.563 --> 47:49.537
How did you get here?

48:07.378 --> 48:09.153
Seon-a...

48:11.799 --> 48:13.046
What the hell is going on?

48:40.123 --> 48:41.754
This is fucked up.

48:44.419 --> 48:45.618
Get your hands off her.

48:46.672 --> 48:47.919
Get them off!

48:53.763 --> 48:56.929
What did you do to Seon-a?

48:57.517 --> 49:00.496
Say something, for fuck's sake!

49:00.520 --> 49:02.343
Ji-uk...

49:22.336 --> 49:23.488
You fucking...

49:46.030 --> 49:47.674
How could you...

49:47.698 --> 49:48.945
to Seon-a!

49:50.368 --> 49:52.431
What have you done?

49:52.954 --> 49:55.113
How is she supposed to live with this?

50:56.734 --> 50:57.885
Detective...

50:59.987 --> 51:01.522
I need your help.

51:26.934 --> 51:28.757
ask you a favor.

51:29.020 --> 51:32.090
You can say no if you want.

51:33.066 --> 51:34.361
Do you like me?

51:35.903 --> 51:38.397
If I were ever to be with someone,

51:39.114 --> 51:41.945
I wanted it to be you.

51:53.714 --> 51:54.858
WHO ARE YOU TALKING TO?
ARE YOU IGNORING ME?

51:54.882 --> 51:56.360
REPORTING ME WON'T GET RID OF THE VIDEOS

51:56.384 --> 51:58.195
IT'S OVER FOR YOU, YOU SLUT

51:58.219 --> 51:59.562
I think

52:01.932 --> 52:03.946
you dropped these earlier.

52:05.477 --> 52:06.629
Detective...

52:07.980 --> 52:09.467
I need your help.

52:10.233 --> 52:12.086
I ran a background check
on your homeroom teacher,

52:12.110 --> 52:13.212
but nothing came up.

52:13.236 --> 52:15.423
Lee Gyu-jin doesn't exist.

52:15.447 --> 52:16.886
The lines above people's heads.

52:17.032 --> 52:18.807
You know what they mean, don't you?

52:19.076 --> 52:20.553
It won't be long

52:20.577 --> 52:24.511
until the whole world is bathed in red.

52:24.582 --> 52:27.844
RED LINES THAT CONNECT SEXUAL PARTNERS
